318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As accidents and emergencies rise, the demand for new tech innovations that can assist people in managing a life-critical situation. This app is intended to quickly render aid in case of fire, car crash, or emergency medical condition by automatically sending the geographical location to ambulance teams when the person in danger is at risk. It also offers a list of emergency numbers with the option to add few close ones to be notified automatically in case of an accident. The application is characterized by its ability to work without an internet connection which guarantees effectiveness even in sites where there is weak or no network. It includes the feature of rapid entry in cases of assault whereby the user can easily activate the application by pressing a specific button in the phone, and the application starts recording audio and sending geographical location coordinates to the police. Furthermore, the application will indicate the nearest police station or hospital to the accident site for ensuring quick response time. It will review the importance of this application its role in personal safety, and the challenges it might face in development.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
