400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (These days, with the increasing number of emergencies  such as car accidents, fires, and health crises, quick action and sound decision-making are essential to save lives and minimize damage. However, many people struggle to cope with these situations due to stress or an inability to quickly access emergency services. Therefore, our app was developed to be a smart voice assistant specifically designed for such situations. It guides the user verbally, helping them take the correct action based on the type of emergency they are facing. It also automatically sends the location to emergency services without the need for an internet connection, ensuring a faster response and contributing to saving lives.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
